{"action": "shared_understanding_confirmed", "at": "2026-09-26T15:33:46+00:00", "data": {"summary": "Products page: In stock / Out of stock / On backorder when Manage Stock is off; all three hide when Manage Stock is on. On backorder is that third status, not Allow backorders. One Save writes Regular, Sale, and stock status; a refused stock write leaves stored status unchanged. New products stay In stock. Commerce store setting (not on the product) shows out-of-stock on the shop or hides them; default is show. Hide covers clerk Out of stock and Inventory-at-zero; On backorder stays visible; unpriced stays hidden; admin still lists every product. Manage Stock, Allow backorders, checkout, shipping, taxes, and description stay later."}, "event_id": "b8cd294e-d3e9-4637-8ba9-a8d0f4b733ef"}
